  "details": "When a Group has multiple nodes and all of them selected, `Remove From Group` operation on the contextual menu item removes only half of nodes. The other half remains.\n--- Details\nThe menu item handler in UdonGraph, it iterates selectedUdonNodesInGroups. Its length (or `Count()`) decrese within that loop. \nSo I think `.ToList()` after `Where()` (or backward for-loop on selectedUdonNodesInGroups) is needed.",
